{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "efbbc4a44766ff2765276070a9684f34c9321dcc864e12f7e8846968ec6c75dc", "ja": "澱", "zh": "沉淀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1877c053a2ada440573d2aa851167e090fbc5d54aa78e13980006eb41e7714cd", "ja": "歌と演技の両立を目指すこととなった\n『FleurS』は、勉強をかねて春香と響の\n舞台を観ることに。しかし会場通路で\n子役時代の桃子に悪感情を抱くスタッフ\nと出会い、憎しみをぶつけられる。", "zh": "决定以兼顾歌唱与演技为目标的\n『FleurS』，为了学习相关经验，\n决定去观看春香和响的舞台演出。然而，她们在会场通道遇到了一名\n对桃子童星时期抱有恶感的工作人员，\n并遭到了对方憎恨的发泄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "34e3c73fb532f322f4ad9ec9976a9c39575e0dfdb67ea7ae3b286c15292a82c7", "ja": "ステージと演技を両立する道を選んだ私たちは、\n新しい挑戦に向けてレッスンに取り組んでいました。", "zh": "选择兼顾舞台和演技这条路的我们，为了迎接新的挑战，一直在认真练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "664f83b83b485390f97dd83fc26df1b98fe5c1ba68aab462ba25a6a162d25ec0", "ja": "そして……。あたたかな春の気配を感じ始めた、\nそんなある日のこと……。", "zh": "然后……在某一天，我们开始感受到温暖的春天气息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1002_null", "source_sha256": "7c836ca1cb1997735dc1877f15698870ac1e85f02e7b87bdced8d298787c1c46", "ja": "都内某劇場　楽屋前の廊下", "zh": "东京都内某剧场　后台前的走廊", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "a672bec7f2d245a5600c4eca135b7c7eaa3742748933d214ccd4fca06afd2ede", "ja": "春香さんと響さんの舞台公演か～！\n楽しみだなぁ～。", "zh": "春香姐和响姐的舞台演出啊——！\n真让人期待呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "4d78eaafed8a14bef235cd69125dde2d7f9a0e2890ae586f9da27cc51cd6af8e", "ja": "前にも言いましたけど、琴葉さんと志保と\n一緒に観にいった舞台が本当に素敵で……♪", "zh": "之前也说过了，我和琴叶，还有志保一起去看的那场舞台真的特别精彩……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "bac118a04acd8bd6a8e01d08c4f6a3d6936498c558ee60133028e2b1c49b7c07", "ja": "フフッ。\nすっかりハマっちゃってるんだから。", "zh": "呵呵。\n你已经彻底迷上了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "9eacfdcea4bd84c2e17f6926610c31996e89dde7e27eaf83cc1a26e78ad440b6", "ja": "お兄ちゃん「生の芝居を見るのはいい勉強になる」\nなんて言ってたけど……", "zh": "哥哥说过“看现场演出会是很好的学习机会”，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "e83462127ac9b63a9dba91b92f905c106b369f8e2a6ea5b0f48258fefa47a9cd", "ja": "肝心のオーディションが未定だし、春予選も近いし、\nこんなことしてていいのかな……。", "zh": "关键的试镜还没定下来，春季预选也快到了，\n现在做这种事真的好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "0df6f0cca187043834db21aba5ff9d22a94c7e934fdc495c761f8dd1d7a57a92", "ja": "まあまあ、練習自体はやるだけやってるんだから、\nこういう日もあってもいいわよ。", "zh": "好了好了，练习本身该练的都已经练过了，\n偶尔有这么一天也无所谓啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "800722a74845a120533ec6be7bde06e507fdfff2230d5ac7389970b0f82181e5", "ja": "あ、お疲れさまでーす。", "zh": "啊，辛苦啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1010_staff", "source_sha256": "3bcc634bdaeb201357d26a6701a0333ed723920f95753de45a42ea1ab4cb6daf", "ja": "はい、お疲れさまです。\n…………周防桃子？", "zh": "好的，辛苦了。\n…………周防桃子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "10b5cfe5b30698ed881a8072c95d7f95a988427e27130d91ffe418ba1179a00f", "ja": "え？　……あっ！", "zh": "咦？……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "5f487105dba4cb09ebe8169080e4505e3a6fd6767ed5115fbb6df85bb05834ad", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、知ってる人だったの？", "zh": "桃子认识的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "b552c8f3f4b3989866ab50b89155c55ccaac545e599b97d04f647ec2a7540968", "ja": "……うん。\n子役の頃、すこし一緒に働いてた人……。", "zh": "……嗯。\n是当童星的时候，一起共事过一阵子的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1014_staff", "source_sha256": "bb69c7af089a69da365db073d48ce74331e32bb007d62b127c05eee859ef1057", "ja": "…………。\nここにいるってことは、芸能界復帰したのか……。", "zh": "…………。\n你会在这里，也就是说已经重返演艺圈了吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "d48799877d3805379d33d1e24eaadb94835d3aca4b2586a8a4b810d9cf1310ff", "ja": "……ごめんなさいね。\n桃子ちゃんになにかご用ですか？", "zh": "……不好意思。\n请问找桃子有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1016_staff", "source_sha256": "8ad68794f323b2516dd43dc25d57c13b086784c6a702f67e955e4bca8d043ccc", "ja": "失礼ですが……あなたがたは？", "zh": "失礼了……请问你们是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "c4c2d689ca1952a6cccec904c6783a1be4e1dd586aad611101c1bfa6ea1b921f", "ja": "765プロダクションの新人アイドル、FleurSです。\n私はリーダーの馬場このみ。", "zh": "我们是765事务所的新人偶像，FleurS。\n我是队长马场木实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1018_staff", "source_sha256": "d50ce0d0fd0e4f01dfbec4d73e252d208369dc998af40d9cd82b23558d7d4a98", "ja": "765プロ……ああ、じゃあ天海さん達の。すみません\n最近は舞台に立つ人しか見てなかったもので……。", "zh": "765艺能……啊，原来是天海小姐她们的事务所啊。不好意思，\n我最近只关注登台表演的人，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1019_staff", "source_sha256": "3582d729f13da42d1f5eceb04f98a9074ed8ddb27fef4947a025df1fe28f20e3", "ja": "……テレビの人間は、もうこりごりですから。", "zh": "……电视台的人，我已经受够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "7c0bb33f64e6c1cef1880c8dbfbe05f9bb60070ff4d0a0bd00ce0d2b0f64b962", "ja": "ご用がないなら失礼します。お疲れさまでした。\nいきましょ、ふたりとも。", "zh": "没事的话，我就先告辞了。辛苦了。\n我们走吧，你们两个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1023_staff", "source_sha256": "008dddbc5fce0889751cb8a51026fcc4723b5119ee03c2f6ee6814b99771f6ad", "ja": "……大変でしょう。周防さんみたいな\n傲慢なだけの子供のお守りをするなんて。", "zh": "……很辛苦吧。要照顾周防这种\n只知道傲慢的小孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "c22e193e50d4f8ab94a374cbd3c7e631497717a834e858fded2ade7db137989c", "ja": "このみさんっ！", "zh": "可怜小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "b32474c8472b661d0ad8998a88848b5385c9f58c2464785edfc288b10ac38aaa", "ja": "いーえ？　大変どころかいつも助けてもらってます。\n桃子ちゃんはいつだって真剣で……", "zh": "哪有？完全不觉得辛苦，倒不如说是她一直在帮我呢。\n桃子无论什么时候都很认真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "9fc83799075ed4ecba8ea76953f89861d99439cfaac12ff2a5612bb08c34f1ff", "ja": "優しくて頑張り屋のとってもいい子ですから。\n私たちは本当にこの子のことが大好きなんですよ。", "zh": "因为她温柔又努力，是个特别好的孩子。\n我们真的非常喜欢她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "4a6ec347165d4abcecacdf12fcf2dfe214bba856964ea454e3a728b2352c117f", "ja": "あなたはなにか勘違いされてるんじゃないですか？", "zh": "您是不是有什么误会呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1029_staff", "source_sha256": "5e5d383c735e2218c9fd450a428e19a4e32e147927522c4acf5248dd4473983c", "ja": "……あぁはい……そうかもしれませんね。\n失礼しました、それじゃ。", "zh": "……啊，是的……也许吧。\n失礼了，那就这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "bba6129735fd2956204ee65369d399859dbfe6e4a4b255aeade98ffa0457634d", "ja": "……腹立つわねー。なにあの態度！\nいーっだ！", "zh": "……真让人生气啊——！什么态度嘛！  \n略——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "799726d9055091a644984e3335fbb22de334550bf6106e6003bfc81f98cb5fae", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、あんなの気にしないでいいからね。", "zh": "桃子，不用在意那种人啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "fe08f01d3bbabd4aba7f07f51f8b86a90f8a74c4ced4b0ecfe786b75975b3194", "ja": "そ、そうだよ桃子ちゃん！　傲慢だなんて……\nあんなデタラメ……。", "zh": "对、对啊，桃子！傲慢什么的……\n那种胡说八道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_04_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "a211dc64edc5055e14224a873d89c2d2a84e6785116e67f462fa443b51aafc1a", "ja": "……デタラメじゃないよ。", "zh": "……不是胡说八道啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
